# What the LAMMPS package of Tadah! holds: the pair style `tadah` and the
# parts of core, models and md it is built from. export/write_package.py
# writes the package from this list and describes the entries: a pattern of
# this repository, then the directory of the package when the files do not
# keep their path; `!` leaves files out; `@` names a file of more entries.
#
# The list is what a LAMMPS build with the package reads from this
# repository: the build files its configure step reads, the sources its
# libraries compile and the headers those include, with the licences.
# tests/export builds LAMMPS from the written tree alone.

# The top of the package: its own README and build file, the licence, the
# pair style and the files that add it to the LAMMPS build.
export/package/README.md        .
export/package/CMakeLists.txt   .
LICENSE
lammps/ML-TADAH/*.h             ML-TADAH
lammps/ML-TADAH/*.cpp           ML-TADAH
lammps/integration/*.cmake      integration

# The library of the pair style and the libraries it is built on, each with
# its build file, the sources it compiles and its headers.
lammps/CMakeLists.txt
lammps/include/**/*.h
lammps/src/*.cpp
md/CMakeLists.txt
md/include/**/*.h
md/src/*.cpp
models/CMakeLists.txt
models/include/**/*.h
models/include/**/*.hpp
models/src/*.cpp
core/CMakeLists.txt
core/include/**/*.h
core/src/*.cpp

# Headers that no source or header of the package includes.
!core/include/tadah/core/small_vec.h
!core/include/tadah/core/stats/column_stats.h
!core/include/tadah/core/stats/data_stats_io.h
!models/include/tadah/models/ekm.h
!models/include/tadah/models/m_blr_train.h
!models/include/tadah/models/m_krr_train.h

# The description of the configuration keys, which core compiles in and
# which holds the version, and the templates it is compiled through.
core/blueprint/blueprint_tadah.toml
core/blueprint/embed/*.in

# The build support that every build file above reads.
cmake/Tadah*.cmake

# Third-party sources bundled with core: toml11 (MIT licence) whole but for
# its tests.
core/external/toml11/CMakeLists.txt
core/external/toml11/LICENSE
core/external/toml11/cmake/*.in
core/external/toml11/toml.hpp
core/external/toml11/toml/*.hpp
